{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":752,\"title\":\"V for Vendetta\",\"tagline\":\"People should not be afraid of their governments. Governments should be afraid of their people.\",\"overview\":\"In a world in which Great Britain has become a fascist state, a masked vigilante known only as “V” conducts guerrilla warfare against the oppressive British government. When V rescues a young woman from the secret police, he finds in her an ally with whom he can continue his fight to free the people of Britain.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1avD1JeaRiJX5M4ahPdZPypGoGN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sFEYsEfzTx7hhjetlNrme8B5OUo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"voteCount\":16207,\"year\":2006,\"runtime\":132,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"DE\",\"name\":\"Germany\"},{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":54000000,\"revenue\":134686457,\"director\":\"James McTeigue\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":11266,\"name\":\"James McTeigue\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8aUklN9PpswTG8DnhVAY92koRMC.jpg\"},{\"id\":524,\"name\":\"Natalie Portman\",\"character\":\"Evey\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/edPU5HxncLWa1YkgRPNkSd68ONG.jpg\"},{\"id\":1331,\"name\":\"Hugo Weaving\",\"character\":\"V / William Rookwood\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lSC8Et0PYi5zeQb3IpPkFje7hgR.jpg\"},{\"id\":9029,\"name\":\"Stephen Rea\",\"character\":\"Finch\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/n52WDwObYghPTfV1TZ1EOVIWUGS.jpg\"},{\"id\":11275,\"name\":\"Stephen Fry\",\"character\":\"Deitrich\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dH7GuUZ8QPM9RN99ak9KKOkSkdS.jpg\"},{\"id\":5049,\"name\":\"John Hurt\",\"character\":\"Adam Sutler\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjNSzt1d7uK3q5PbtFXUJrRt4qg.jpg\"},{\"id\":11276,\"name\":