und.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":70160,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/apa5G43Hha7kH7wJG0gkkHT7FA9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eVYChqJavS1DCXFeJE2lzVUMLKp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In a dystopian society where the Capitol forces each district to send two young tributes to fight to the death in a televised spectacle, a girl volunteers to take her sister’s place, setting the stage for a struggle of survival and defiance.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1265609,\"title\":\"War Machine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rFhKkXhk7ClU03jQ5rHIApJDwev.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6yeVcxFR0j08vlv2OlL6zbewm4D.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On one last grueling mission during Army Ranger training, a combat engineer must lead his unit in a fight against a giant otherworldly killing machine.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198663,\"title\":\"The Maze Runner\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ode14q7WtDugFDp78fo9lCsmay9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eTlcNXGv32zkVI7ZDHhfeaKHXKQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A teenager with no memory of his past finds himself among a group of boys living in a walled enclosure surrounded by a massive, ever-changing maze. As he struggles to adapt to their rules and society, he begins to uncover clues that may lead to escape and the truth behind their confinement.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":577922,\"title\":\"Tenet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rrKH3VhHssGTCfPuaEQkxvEoElv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mQOUyqDybTqxl73hO5LujCZsM1o.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Armed with only one word - Tenet - and fighting for the survival of the entire world, the Protagonist journeys through a twilight world of international espionage on a mission that will unfold in something beyond real time.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1323244,\"title\":\"Rage of Stars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oLld47ZT1I3iecM3OWhIphohQUJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z7lZgL5tzefTfhyRtouThFhsuUS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A story about a woman from the International Special Forces Unit, who has a premonition about the impending end of humanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":822119,\"title\":\"Captain America: Brave New World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzIddUEMWhWzfvLI3TwxUG2wGoi.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ce3prrjh9ZehEl5JinNqr4jIeaB.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After meeting with newly elected U.S. President Thaddeus Ross, Sam finds himself in the middle of an international incident. He must discover the reason behind a nefarious global plot before the true mastermind has the entire world seeing red.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":262500,\"title\":\"Insurgent\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dP5Fb6YRfzmCQtRbHOr2kO7tJW9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8YNNyQiPZlF9qv5EGOUK20mnXVk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Beatrice Prior must confront her inner demons and continue her fight against a powerful alliance which threatens to tear her society apart.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":135397,\"title\":\"Jurassic World\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bkXjL03yWPmiuFqxWEp4zSYVZBY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dF6FjTZzRTENfB4R17HDN20jLT2.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Twenty-two years after the events of Jurassic Park, Isla Nublar now features a fully functioning dinosaur theme park, Jurassic World, as originally envisioned by John Hammond.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":604,\"title\":\"The Matrix Reloaded\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8xEVAe84zlL9rkfYT6dZXero4KK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ihOJcrorpDQtHTzIOrobbOhpJsj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Resistance builds in numbers as humans are freed from the Matrix and brought to the city of Zion. Neo discovers his superpowers, including the ability to see the code inside the Matrix. With machine sentinels digging to Zion in 72 hours, Neo, Morpheus and Trinity must find the Keymaker to ultimately reach the Source.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":49530,\"title\":\"In Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3Mwj2sIONQckOZP3YwsUXF7U5I4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pxL08w7Eq0vKrQ3mJzYp0VHGaKG.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the not-too-distant future, the aging gene has been switched off. To avoid overpopulation, time has become the currency and the way people pay for luxuries and necessities. The rich can live forever, while the rest struggle to negotiate for their immortality. A poor young man who suddenly comes into a fortune of time finds himself on the run from a corrupt police force known as the \\\"time keepers\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":798645,\"title\":\"The Running Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dKL78O9zxczVgjtNcQ9UkbYLzqX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aHj7d7wSLqrg5cjAcgHhiGr97Ih.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Desperate to save his sick daughter, working-class Ben Richards is convinced by The Running Man's charming but ruthless producer to enter the deadly competition game as a last resort. But Ben's defiance, instincts, and grit turn him into an unexpected fan favorite — and a threat to the entire system. As ratings skyrocket, so does the danger, and Ben must outwit not just the Hunters, but a nation addicted to watching him fall.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Thriller\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"krWn5ta9RG4\",\"name\":\"20th Anniversary\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"3ge0navn9E0\",\"name\":\"20th Anniversary Announcement | ONE YEAR FROM TONIGHT\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"V5VGq23aZ-g\",\"name\":\"4K Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}